  "description": "University student Da-Mi is looking for roommates, and finds Hae-Mi and Eun-Mi, two of her classmates. They all move into her late grandmother's house, which holds memories of her elementary school days. But with a keen interest in food, Da-Mi's meals are too delicious to eat alone! Dami and her friends are a delightfully cheeky bunch!\n\n(Source: Manhwakyung, translated)",
